      "seg_id": "N01",
      "text": "Look closely at the machine that launched modern rocketry in nineteen twenty-six. It had no outer skin and no nose cone\u2014just a tiny nozzle pulling two fuel tanks on naked metal pipes.",
      "delivery": "HOOK",
      "rate": "-1%",
      "pitch": "-1Hz",
