        "boosters"
      ]
    },
    {
      "seg_id": "N04",
      "text": "Mid-sixties rockets left raw machinery wide open. Gemini's Titan Two fired twin engines inside an exposed steel frame. And for Saturn One-B in nineteen sixty-six, NASA bolted eight narrow missile tanks in a circle\u2014above eight tightly packed engines.",
      "delivery": "MEASURED_EVIDENCE",
      "rate": "-1%",
      "pitch": "-1Hz",
      "start": 43.781,
      "end": 60.127,
      "duration": 16.346,
