        "eight",
        "engines"
      ]
    },
    {
      "seg_id": "N05",
      "text": "Then nineteen sixty-nine unveiled a thirty-six-story colossus: Saturn Five. Beneath its hull hung five cavernous F-1 nozzles\u2014each nearly four meters wide in rough silver batting\u2014unleashing seven point five million pounds of thrust as ice cascaded down its sides.",
      "delivery": "ESCALATION",
