    {
      "seg_id": "N06",
      "text": "In nineteen eighty-one, rocket geometry broke symmetry completely. The Space Shuttle mounted a black ceramic-tiled glider beside a giant orange tank, firing three computer-throttled hydrogen engines glowing with blue shock diamonds.",
