      "text": "Physics still forces propellant to fill nearly ninety percent of every rocket's mass. Yet today, NASA's Artemis super-rocket fuses four laser-upgraded RS-25 engines with twin boosters\u2014unleashing eight point eight million pounds of thrust back toward the Moon.",
